#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox)
#: bookmarks.ui:16
#, kde-format
msgid "Bookmarks"
msgstr "Knjižne oznake"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbShowRoot)
#: bookmarks.ui:23
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If this option is unchecked, bookmarks at the root of the hierarchy (not in "
"a folder) are not displayed.\n"
"If checked, they are gathered in a \"root\" folder."
msgstr ""
"Ako ova mogućnost nije označena, knjižne oznake u korijenu hijerarhije (koje "
"nisu u mapi) neće se prikazivati.\n"
"Ako je označena, objedinit će se u „korijenskoj” mapi."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbShowRoot)
#: bookmarks.ui:26
#, kde-format
msgid "&Show bookmarks without folder"
msgstr "&Prikaži knjižne oznake bez mape"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbFlattenTree)
#: bookmarks.ui:37
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Sub-folders are shown within their parent by default. If you activate this "
"option, sub-folders are displayed on their own.\n"
"It looks less nice but it may help if you have a very big folder you want to "
"spread in two columns."
msgstr ""
"Podmape se po zadanim postavkama prikazuju unutar nadređene mape. Ako "
"omogućite ovu mogućnost, podmape će se prikazivati zasebno.\n"
"Izgledat će manje lijepo, ali može pomoći ako imate vrlo veliku mapu koju "
"želite rasporediti u dva stupca."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbFlattenTree)
#: bookmarks.ui:40
#, kde-format
msgid "&Flatten bookmarks tree"
msgstr "&Izravnaj stablo knjižnih oznaka"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbShowPlaces)
#: bookmarks.ui:47
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Show a box with KDE places (Home, Network, ...). Useful if you use konqueror "
"as a file manager."
msgstr "Prikaži okvir s KDE-ovim mjestima (Početna mapa, Mreža itd.). Korisno ako Konqueror koristite kao upravitelj datoteka."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbShowPlaces)
#: bookmarks.ui:50
#, kde-format
msgid "Show system &places"
msgstr "Prikaži &sistemska mjesta"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_2)
#: bookmarks.ui:63
#, kde-format
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Opće postavke"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, label)
#: bookmarks.ui:71
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Folders are automatically distributed in several columns. The optimal number "
"of columns depends on the width of the konqueror window and the number of "
"bookmarks you have."
msgstr "Mape se automatski raspoređuju u nekoliko stupaca. Optimalan broj stupaca ovisi o širini Konquerorova prozora i broju knjižnih oznaka."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#: bookmarks.ui:74
#, kde-format
msgid "Number of columns to show:"
msgstr "Broj stupaca za prikaz:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbShowBackgrounds)
#: bookmarks.ui:109
#, kde-format
msgid "Disable it on slow system to disable background images."
msgstr "Onemogućite ovo na sporom sustavu kako biste isključili pozadinske slike."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbShowBackgrounds)
#: bookmarks.ui:112
#, kde-format
msgid "Show folder &backgrounds"
msgstr "Prikaži &pozadine mapa"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_3)
#: bookmarks.ui:138
#, kde-format
msgid "How much disk space is used to cache the pixmaps"
msgstr "Koliko se prostora na disku koristi za predmemoriju rasterskih slika"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_3)
#: bookmarks.ui:141
#, kde-format
msgid "Pixmap Cache"
msgstr "Predmemorija rasterskih slika"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, lbMaxCacheSize)
#: bookmarks.ui:150
#, kde-format
msgid "Disk cache size:"
msgstr "Veličina predmemorije na disku:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (suffix), widget (QSpinBox, sbCacheSize)
#: bookmarks.ui:163
#, kde-format
msgid " kB"
msgstr " kB"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, clearCacheButton)
#: bookmarks.ui:173
#, kde-format
msgid "Clear the pixmap cache"
msgstr "Očisti predmemoriju rasterskih slika"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, clearCacheButton)
#: bookmarks.ui:176
#, kde-format
msgid "&Clear Cache"
msgstr "&Očisti predmemoriju"
